title: mf log rollback
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Event log]]
kind: reference
summary: Go back to a time: revert your changes since then (not the watcher's)

Goes back to the state at a time — `2h`, an ISO-8601 date in UTC, `@<ms>` — by reverting what you wrote since onto the current state; `plan` previews it ([[Rollback]]).
